            "treatment.0",
            "treatment.1",
            "treatment.2",
            "treatment.3"
          ],
          "text": "A septic screen was performed including bloods, blood culture and CRP; LP was deferred given stable respiratory status. CRP rose from 28 to 41 on day 1 before falling to 18 on day 2. Blood cultures were negative at both 36 and 48 hours. IV benzylpenicillin and gentamicin were commenced per neonatal sepsis protocol; given the clinical picture and initial CRP rise, a decision was made to complete a 5-day course of IV antibiotics, which was completed on day 5. Routine newborn checks were performed and the newborn hearing screen was passed.",
